nd societal impacts.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"HEALTH_AND_INFRASTRUCTURE_ALERT_SEPARATION","direct_score_input":false},{"row":39,"status":"PASS_NSWWS_COLOUR_LEVELS","source":"Met Office weather warnings guide","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/guides/warnings","verified":"National Severe Weather Warnings use yellow, amber and red colours.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"NSWWS_COLOUR_CONTRACT","direct_score_input":false},{"row":40,"status":"PASS_NSWWS_IMPACT_LIKELIHOOD_MATRIX","source":"Met Office weather warnings guide","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/guides/warnings","verified":"Warning colour is based on a combination of impact and likelihood.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"WEATHER_WARNING_MATRIX","direct_score_input":false},{"row":41,"status":"PASS_YELLOW_WARNING_DETAIL_GATE","source":"Met Office warning guidance","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/warnings-and-advice/seasonal-advice/when-and-why-do-we-issue-warnings","verified":"Yellow warnings cover a range of impact and likelihood combinations, so users must read the detailed warning content.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"YELLOW_WARNING_DETAIL_REQUIRED","direct_score_input":false},{"row":42,"status":"PASS_AMBER_WARNING_DISRUPTION","source":"Met Office warning guidance","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/warnings-and-advice/seasonal-advice/when-and-why-do-we-issue-warnings","verified":"Amber warnings indicate disruption is more likely and more widespread.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"AMBER_WARNING_DISRUPTION_SEMANTIC","direct_score_input":false},{"row":43,"status":"PASS_RED_WARNING_DANGEROUS_WEATHER","source":"Met Office warning guidance","url":"https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/warnings-and-advice/seasonal-advice/when-and-why-do-we-issue-warnings","verified":"Red warnings are reserved for very dangerous weather with high confidence.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"RED_WARNING_DANGER_SEMANTIC","direct_score_input":false},{"row":44,"status":"PASS_WITH_LIVE_HEALTH_ALERT_CA